# Sagu Pummeler ({3}{G}, 4/4 reach): "Renew -- {4}{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put two +1/+1 counters and a reach
# counter on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus's {G}{G}{G} and Mox Emerald)
# and kills it on turn 3 with Go for the Throat; Bot2 casts an Ornithopter on turn 2. On turn 5, with Bot1's Ornithopter on the
# stack and five Moxen to pay, renew is refused (sorcery timing); after it resolves renew is refused on Mox Emerald (not a
# creature), then puts two +1/+1 counters and a reach counter on Bot1's Ornithopter, exiling the Pummeler as the cost.

